{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）首度挑戰接拍以馬來西亞文藝電影《告別的年代》。</p><p>片中他聯同台灣女演員宋芸樺合作演出。</p><p>Stanley稱今年是自己「豐收年」，冀盼可以打破以往偶像男團成員既定形象，晉身成為受大家認同的實力派。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:13.316523+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:16:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:38:56.045126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:26.407547+00:00","content_hash":"b89c0d59b794c2f469c9973db6e4f21a8a225b2c11f1064b327cebed97f41506","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}